      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay 5ml sounds right but he's still acting pretty crazy and running really high. he seems super sleepy though, like more than usual. i already gave him 5ml like 2 hours ago and he's still super hot. can i give him another 5ml now to be safe so the fever breaks faster? or maybe even 7ml to make sure? i just want him to stop acting weird and go to sleep.",
